clientRelationshipsFound.single.p2=We will add these authorisations to your agent services account.
clientRelationshipsFound.multi.title=Client authorisations found
clientRelationshipsFound.multi.p1=Your Government Gateway user ID currently has:
clientRelationshipsFound.multi.td=authorisations for Self Assessment clients
clientRelationshipsFound.multi.p2=We will add these authorisations to your agent services account.
clientRelationshipsFound.max=or more Self Assessment clients
clientRelationshipsFound.inset=Adding an authorisation just copies it to your agent services account. You will not lose any access or permissions to manage Self Assessment for your clients in your HMRC online services account.

