gg-tag.title=Enter the last 4 numbers of the Government Gateway user ID you signed in with
gg-tag.p1=We’ll use this as a reference number to show you which client authorisations you’ve added to your agent services account.
gg-tag.form.hint=For example, XXXX-XXXX-1234
gg-tag.xs=XXXX-XXXX-

