userTheGgUserId.title=Use the Government Gateway user ID for agent code {0}
userTheGgUserId.heading=Use the Government Gateway user ID for agent code {0}
userTheGgUserId.para.1=On the next page, we’ll ask you to sign in through the Government Gateway. This will sign you out of your agent services account.
userTheGgUserId.para.2=When prompted, enter the user ID and password linked to the agent code {0}.
userTheGgUserId.para.3=Signing in will:
userTheGgUserId.bullet.1=confirm this agent code was given to you by HMRC
userTheGgUserId.bullet.2=allow us to link all authorisations under the code to your agent services account
userTheGgUserId.button=Continue

wrongSignInDetails.title=You entered the wrong sign in details
wrongSignInDetails.heading=You entered the wrong sign in details
wrongSignInDetails.para.1.asa=The sign in details you entered are for your agent services account.
wrongSignInDetails.para.1.notAgent=The sign in details you entered are not for an agent account.
wrongSignInDetails.para.2=Enter a Government Gateway user ID and password you use to manage Self Assessment for your clients.
