problemWithDetails.title=There is a problem with the details you entered
problemWithDetails.heading=There is a problem with the details you entered
problemWithDetails.para.1=The details do not match what we hold in our records.
problemWithDetails.para.2=This might be because:
problemWithDetails.bullet.1=the agent code you entered is not for Self Assessment
problemWithDetails.bullet.2=the Government gateway user ID you entered is not used to manage Self Assessment clients
problemWithDetails.bullet.3=the agent code you entered is for Self Assessment, but it’s linked to a different user ID than than the one you entered
problemWithDetails.button=Try again